Package: qmdme
Title: Generate Quarto Code Companions for Source Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Brandt", email = "jesse.a.brandt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Produces and updates 'eval=FALSE' Quarto companion files
    for source code in a research repository. Each source file gets a
    'qmd/' file with a user-editable prose region above an
    auto-regenerated code chunk, suitable for inclusion in a Quarto site.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    fs,
    glue
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
